The Senior Interactive Project Manager (SPM) works closely with the Clients Interactive Producers to implement campaigns in the assigned region . The SPM is expected to lead and manage digital projects while bringing together a multi-disciplinary team comprising of internal and external resources as required . He/she needs to provide an optimum interactive solution for the client that answers the brief within all the necessary specified style and technical guidelines.  &nbsp;

This person will work closely with Front-End Developers, Production Designers and QA Engineers on a day-to-day basis and will also need to engage with other cross-functional teams of project managers to ensure work is delivered on time, on quality and within budget. &nbsp;

&nbsp;

The Senior Interactive PM’s primary task is to lead his/her team and that includes creating structure and processes that support the development of excellent work. He/She will manage quarterly planning efforts to align resources and funding, to prioritize, manage budgets, distribute workload, and personnel management. &nbsp;

&nbsp;

